{"name": "grubkins", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras/7aa134ad3550da7c00f8e0603f130076.poster.avif?t=1772559502\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras/7aa134ad3550da7c00f8e0603f130076.webm?t=1772559502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras/7aa134ad3550da7c00f8e0603f130076.mp4?t=1772559502\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras/c2749243160e3ca990a32806c6673576.avif?t=1772559502\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They are strange little creatures that hatch from eggs. They come in all sorts of shapes and sizes and some are even rare! They might not be the strongest or the smartest but with your help they could still become legendary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras/c1adee175d7dfa91c3db7c2a243fd2a7.poster.avif?t=1772559502\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras/c1adee175d7dfa91c3db7c2a243fd2a7.webm?t=1772559502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras/c1adee175d7dfa91c3db7c2a243fd2a7.mp4?t=1772559502\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras/e77eb32af8c4d8e0c77655f6356a5912.avif?t=1772559502\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of things! You can pick them up and move them around. You can give them items and equipment to use. You can feed them snacks to heal their injuries. You can train them to be a variety of classes like warlock, cleric, druid, thief or lightning wizard. You can get them to explore dangerous places to see if they find treasures or snacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras/66b8a2a4c949c80671ed173a958dd6ec.poster.avif?t=1772559502\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras/66b8a2a4c949c80671ed173a958dd6ec.webm?t=1772559502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras/66b8a2a4c949c80671ed173a958dd6ec.mp4?t=1772559502\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras/ac6a63a0a081110e5b7cec8ced59ff56.avif?t=1772559502\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you finish preparing, your grubkins will battle the enemies of this cursed dungeon. Each fight is physically driven and the forces of combat can drastically change the outcome. Swords clash, spells unleashed, potions consumed\u2026 If at least one grubkin is left standing, there may be hope yet still of reaching the bottom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras/572db0f7786020b72bfb842658eb15fd.poster.avif?t=1772559502\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras/572db0f7786020b72bfb842658eb15fd.webm?t=1772559502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras/572db0f7786020b72bfb842658eb15fd.mp4?t=1772559502\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/extras/eec82075d68fc6a2ea925b5c7088c947.avif?t=1772559502\" width=\"1560\"/></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ grubkins to discover and add to your party</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 30+ items to loot and discover on your journey in the dungeon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">grubkins can gain classes with unique abilities and talent trees like Thief, Druid or Lightning Wizard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">upgrade your party as they level up by assigned stats and talent points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">first 2 floors available in demo (5 floors in the full game)</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Lead a party of helpless runts as they attempt to reach the bottom of a dungeon. Survive physics-based auto-battles with deadly enemies to find powerful weapons, chaotic spells and valuable treasure!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971040/b677d20dbbaadf08c260946451668fd3da438f03/header.jpg?t=1772559502", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Inventory Management", "Loot", "Auto Battler", "Dungeon Crawler", "Roguelike"], "developers": "Leafy Games", "publishers": "Leafy Games", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3971040", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "3 March 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/p9gRX7XFECo", "first_seen": 1772492400.0, "review_rank": 1063}